ImCharge Prototype — Complete Master Prompt for Google Build AI
PART 1: PROJECT OVERVIEW
Project Name
ImCharge — EV Charging Marketplace Platform

Vision
A two-sided marketplace connecting EV drivers with charging locations: existing company-owned stations (via partner APIs) and private host charging points (home, shop, office, parking).

Core Features (MVP)
Driver app — find, reserve, and pay for charging
Host app — list charging points and manage bookings
Reservation engine — 30-minute holds, real-time availability
Two payment models — commission (company stations) + metered billing (private hosts)
Maps integration — location-based search and navigation
Meter verification — for private host charging sessions
Technology Stack
Backend: Google Cloud Run (containerized Node.js/Python)
Database: Firestore (real-time, document-based)
AI/ML: Vertex AI (recommendations, availability prediction)
Maps: Google Maps API (search, routing, geolocation)
Auth: Firebase Authentication
Payments: Stripe (or local payment gateway)
Frontend: React (web) + React Native (mobile)
